# Clean-room: never commit captured analysis outputs. Authorized reference outputs
# (reference.json) and Ghidra reference outputs (ghidra.json) are kept locally only and diffed in
# place; MacScope's own emitted snapshots (macscope.json) are reproducible and need not be
# tracked. Only README.md, this file, and the reproducible corpus/ sources are.
**/reference.json
**/ghidra.json
**/macscope.json
# Built corpus binaries (reproducible from corpus/*.{swift,m} via Scripts/build_golden_corpus.sh).
swift_corpus/swift_corpus
objc_corpus/objc_corpus
# Per-image-container refactor: local, host-specific pre-refactor byte anchors
# (captured from this host's /bin/ls). Reproducible; a same-host developer gate,
# not a portable committed fixture.
prerefactor/
